# Why This File Was Renamed

The root vercel.json was causing build failures when Vercel Root Directory is set to 'frontend'.

## The Problem
- Vercel Root Directory: 'frontend' → build context is already IN frontend/
- Root vercel.json: "cd frontend && npm ci" → tries to change INTO frontend/ again
- Result: Module resolution conflicts, missing native binaries

## Solution
- Deleted root vercel.json
- All Vercel configuration should be in frontend/vercel.json (if needed)
- Or rely on Vercel's auto-detection with Root Directory = 'frontend'

## Reference
See docs/VERCEL_CONFIG_NOTES.md for architecture details.

Date: 2025-01-11
Issue: Lightning CSS native binary not found
